    "title": "_CompactLogicalCandidate",
    "type": "object",
    "description": "Return only new or changed Logical records in the three arrays; omitted saved records stay as they are. Cite tables by table_index id (t1) and columns as t1.column. For a saved Entity or Attribute, send its identity plus only the fields you change. The backend adds each new Entity's <Entity>ID key, audit columns, column and dependency order, locks and the parent key of each Relationship, and copies a missing Attribute definition from its single source column's Project description. Relationships point from the child's foreign-key Attribute to the parent Entity. Retire saved records in retire; nothing is deleted. Coverage target is 70% of distinct selected Objects, rounded up, through active Entity sources, including unchanged saved records. On repair, fix every context.repair.validation_issues entry and return the complete corrected answer, not a patch."
  },
